<rml>
<head>
  <title>Recovery</title>
  <link type="text/rcss" href="../themes/apps.rcss"/>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="bar" data-model="nav">
    <span class="app">{{app}}</span>
    <span class="tab" data-for="tab : tabs" data-attr-id="'nav-' + tab.id" data-class-current="current == tab.id" data-event-click="nav_go(tab.id)">{{tab.title}}</span>
    <span class="spacer"></span>
    <span class="status" data-if="status != ''">{{status}}</span>
    <span id="nav-lock" class="tab" data-event-click="nav_lock()">Lock</span>
  </div>
  <div class="page" data-model="wrecov">
    <div class="card" data-if="has_pending">
      <h1>Check it: {{from}}</h1>
      <div class="facts">
        <div class="item" data-for="line : lines">
          <span class="label">{{line.label}}</span>
          <span class="value">{{line.value}}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="muted">{{signers}}</p>
      <div class="row">
        <button id="action-send" class="primary" data-if="can_send" data-event-click="action_send()" data-attrif-disabled="busy">Sign and send</button>
        <button id="action-file" data-event-click="action_file()" data-attrif-disabled="busy">Save as an operation file…</button>
        <button id="action-cancel" data-event-click="action_cancel()" data-attrif-disabled="busy">Cancel</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="notice" data-if="notice != ''">{{notice}}</p>
    <p class="error" data-if="error != ''">{{error}}</p>
    <div data-if="!has_pending">
      <div class="card" data-if="has_chosen">
        <h1>Recovery of {{chosen}}</h1>
        <p class="muted">A way back if every key of the account is lost: recovery keys — people you trust, or a
          backup key you keep apart from this wallet — can name its new keys. They take over after a delay, in
          which this account's keys can cancel it: a recovery key alone cannot take the account.</p>
        <p id="recovery-now" data-if="now != ''">{{now}}</p>
        <div data-if="is_announced">
          <p id="recovery-announced" class="warning">{{announced}}</p>
          <button id="recovery-cancel" class="primary" data-event-click="recov_cancel()" data-attrif-disabled="busy">Cancel the recovery</button>
        </div>
        <h2>Set its recovery</h2>
        <p class="muted">Each recovery key from its key card (Keys, Save key card…, in the holder's wallet).</p>
        <div class="item" data-for="k : set_keys">
          <span class="grow">{{k.name}} <span class="muted">{{k.fingerprint}}</span></span>
          <button class="small" data-event-click="recov_set_drop(it_index)">Remove</button>
        </div>
        <button id="recovery-add-card" data-event-click="recov_set_card()" data-attrif-disabled="busy">Add a key card…</button>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="grow">
            <label>Recovery keys that must sign</label>
            <input id="recovery-needed" class="field" type="text" data-value="set_needed"/>
          </div>
          <div class="grow">
            <label>Days you have to cancel</label>
            <input id="recovery-days" class="field" type="text" data-value="days"/>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <button id="recovery-set" class="primary" data-event-click="recov_set()" data-attrif-disabled="busy">Set the recovery</button>
          <button id="recovery-remove" data-if="has_set" data-event-click="recov_remove()" data-attrif-disabled="busy">Remove the recovery</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h2>Recover an account</h2>
        <p class="muted">When you hold one of an account's recovery keys and its owner lost all of theirs: name its
          new keys — the owner's key card, from their new wallet — or a new key made here, if the account is
          yours. The other recovery keys sign too, as the account set it.</p>
        <label>The account (its number)</label>
        <input id="recover-account" class="field" type="text" data-value="target"/>
        <div class="item" data-for="k : new_keys">
          <span class="grow">{{k.name}} <span class="muted">{{k.fingerprint}}</span></span>
          <button class="small" data-event-click="recov_new_drop(it_index)">Remove</button>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <button id="recover-add-card" data-event-click="recov_new_card()" data-attrif-disabled="busy">Add the owner's key card…</button>
          <button id="recover-new-key" data-event-click="recov_new_key()" data-attrif-disabled="busy">Make a new key here</button>
        </div>
        <label>New keys that must sign</label>
        <input id="recover-needed" class="field" type="text" data-value="new_needed"/>
        <button id="recover-announce" class="primary" data-event-click="recov_announce()" data-attrif-disabled="busy">Announce its new keys</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</rml>
